'''Magma''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black with orange lava cracks imprinted on it, resembling molten magma, hence the name. The guard is orange, and the handle is solid black.

